// A captivity: the player is held and chooses each round. Struggle counts
// toward `escape at`; the other choices are relabelled for a gentle scene.
// `status:` replaces the default status line.

== captivity bramble_snare
name: Caught in the brambles
escape at: 3
pause after each: no
status: Vines snapped: [captivity.struggle] of 3
struggle label: Pull free
oblige label: Hold still
abide label: Hold still
endure label: Catch your breath
recover label: Think it through
start:
    Thorny vines wind around your ankles and hold on.
situation:
    The brambles hold your legs[if captivity.struggle > 0], though some have snapped[end if].
struggle:
    You twist and tug at the vines.
escape:
    The last vine snaps and you stumble free.
oblige:
    You hold still. The vines loosen a little, then tighten again.
abide:
    You hold still. The vines loosen a little, then tighten again.
endure:
    You take a slow breath and look for the thinnest vines.
recover:
    You spot the vine holding everything together.
    ~ captivity.struggle + 1 quietly
// `lost` plays if the player's humanity falls to 0 while held; nothing in this
// pack lowers it, so it is here to show the field.
lost:
    You never do get free of that thicket.
    ~ ending lost_in_the_brambles
